// Planted BOAT WITH B IN PARTS (17 Oct 2026), after Martínez-Peña and Ylikoski (2024): B is agents'
// attributes, a whole the text breaks into the action situation, mental states and capacities, two
// of them in a loop, each bearing on C. A whole's parts come before it in the chart's order, so
// B's compartment once stood columns away from A with empty columns between; the page closes them up.
===
title: "Planted -- a boat whose B has parts"
mechanism:
    question: "How does a macro change bring about a macro outcome through agents?"
    levels: [macro, micro]
    ordering: scale
    actors:
        agents: {label: "Agents", level: micro}
    states:
        macroA:   {label: "A macro change (A)", levels: [macro], role: condition}
        attrB:    {label: "Agents' attributes change (B)", actor: agents}
        actsit:   {label: "Agents' action situation changes", actor: agents, part_of: attrB}
        mental:   {label: "Agents' mental states change", actor: agents, part_of: attrB}
        capacity: {label: "Agents' capacities", actor: agents, part_of: attrB}
        behC:     {label: "Agents' behaviour changes (C)", actor: agents}
        macroD:   {label: "The macro outcome (D)", levels: [macro], role: outcome}
===

[The boat]: A macro change brings about a macro outcome through what agents are and do.

[Arrow 1]: A change in A brings about a change in B.
    {causes: {from: macroA, to: attrB, sign: which, basis: asserted, mark: "1"}}
    +> [The boat]

[Arrow 2]: The changes in B bring about changes in behaviour.
    {causes: {from: attrB, to: behC, sign: which, basis: asserted, mark: "2"}}
    +> [The boat]

[Situation to mind]: Agents must learn of a change in their situation for it to change what they believe.
    {causes: {from: actsit, to: mental, sign: which, basis: asserted}}
    +> [The boat]

[Learning loop]: Learning expands capacities, and capacities shape what agents come to believe.
    {causes: [{from: mental, to: capacity, sign: "+", basis: asserted}, {from: capacity, to: mental, sign: "+", basis: asserted}]}
    +> [The boat]

[Each part to behaviour]: Each of B's parts bears on what agents do: the situation through what they believe, what they believe, and what they can do.
    {causes: [{from: actsit, to: behC, sign: which, via: [mental], basis: asserted, mark: "2"}, {from: mental, to: behC, sign: which, basis: asserted, mark: "2"}, {from: capacity, to: behC, sign: "+", basis: asserted, mark: "2"}]}
    +> [The boat]

[Arrow 3]: Agents' actions change their own and others' later situations.
    {causes: {from: behC, to: attrB, sign: which, basis: asserted, mark: "3"}}
    +> [The boat]

[Arrow 4]: Behavioural changes add up to the macro outcome.
    {causes: {from: behC, to: macroD, sign: which, basis: asserted, mark: "4"}}
    +> [The boat]
